Revision history for Mogura

0.01
    - Run the web server as an ordinary user and connect Linux scanners with
      individual credentials. Each scanner reports its disks and claims its
      assigned jobs.
    - Scan the host filesystem or a read-only ext4 or XFS disk with Syft and
      Grype. Cancel queued or running scans and check disk cleanup status.
    - Search packages and vulnerabilities, edit tags and notes, and download
      the original artifacts in the English or Japanese web interface.
